{ Original Scandinavian Defense course. Study material, not a historical game. } 1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Nf6 3. d4 Bg4 4. f3 Bf5 { Authored anchor. Black delays recapturing again to develop the bishop and provoke f3. White gains a center but has weakened dark squares. } 5. g4 Bg6 6. c4 e6 7. Nc3 c5 8. Be3 exd5 9. g5 Nh5 10. dxc5 d4 { Plan: Calculate central blows and develop rapidly. The bishop retreat must preserve activity while the d5 pawn remains unresolved. Opponent resource: White may hold the pawn and build a powerful center. Treat this as advanced optional material after mastering the main repertoire. } *

