{ Original Scandinavian Defense course. Study material, not a historical game. } 1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qe5+ 4. Be2 Qxe2+ 5. Ngxe2 { Plan: Reconstruct the legal knight move and explain why a check was not a shield. In real games, retreat the queen rather than continuing an unsound raid. Opponent resource: A forcing-looking sequence can still end with the attacking queen trapped or exchanged at a huge loss. } *

